While guessing the income of the spouse, when the sources of income are either not disclosed or not correctly disclosed, the Court can take into consideration the following factors:
 (i) Life style of the spouse;
 (ii) The amount spent at the time of marriage and the manner in which marriage was performed;
(iii) Destination of honeymoon;
